ns","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-with-confluence-cloud.md","line":358},{"title":"Atlassian Administration portal","target":"https://admin.atlassian.com/","line":368},{"title":"software models","target":"c_CreatingSoftwareModels","line":416},{"title":"Subscription exclusions for SaaS and SSO applications","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/subscription-exclusions.md","line":428},{"title":"Create a child alias to set up multiple Confluence Cloud integration profiles","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/create-child-alias-confluence.md","line":430},{"title":"Review a software reclamation rule","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/add-reclamation-rule-sub.md","line":432},{"title":"Create entitlements in Software Asset Management classic","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/track-software-rights.md","line":436},{"title":"Create entitlements in workspace","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/create-entitlements-workspace.md","line":437},{"title":"Create entitlements using the guided walk-through","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/guidedwalk-workspace.md","line":438},{"title":"License Workbench","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/sam-license-workbench.md","line":440},{"title":"License usage view","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/sam-workspace-workbench.md","line":440},{"title":"Run software reconciliation in Software Asset Management classic","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/t_RunReconciliation.md","line":442},{"title":"Run software reconciliation in the workspace","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/run-recon-workspace.md","line":443},{"title":"Software Asset Management","target":"c_SoftwareAssetMgmt","line":447},{"title":"SaaS License Management","target":"sam-subscription-management","line":448},{"title":"Using Software Asset Workspace","target":"using-sam-workspace","line":449},{"title":"Software Asset Workspace","target":"sam-workspace","line":450},{"title":"Software reclamation rules","target":"sw-reclamation-rules","line":451},{"title":"Software models","target":"c_CreatingSoftwareModels","line":452}],"metadata":{"title":"Integrating with Confluence Cloud","description":"Integrating your Software Asset Management application with the Confluence Cloud application enables you to track your software subscriptions and to reclaim unused licenses.Create a Confluence Cloud OAuth 2.0 \\(3LO\\) application to enable access to the Confluence Cloud API.Obtain the value of the Cloud ID of the Confluence Cloud cloud instance. This value is required during the configuration of the connection record in your ServiceNow instance.Create a Confluence Cloud integration profile to track software subscriptions and optimize licensing for your Confluence Cloud applications.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-with-confluence-cloud.html","release":"australia","product":"SaaS Licens